      "id": 1,
      "text": "Willow Creek calls itself the Bigfoot capital of the world, hosts a Bigfoot Museum, and celebrates the annual Bigfoot Daze festival each September.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
